>> title: Scallion Pancakes
>> category: Flatbreads & Pancakes
>> tags: chinese, scallion, layered, skillet, vegan
>> counters: Dim Sum Counter, Takeout Counter
>> aka: cong you bing, congyoubing, 蔥油餅, green onion pancake
>> servings: 4
>> time: 1 hr

Stir @all-purpose flour{2%cup}(260 g) with @boiling water{1/2%cup}(120 mL).

>> step: knead smooth, rest 30 min
Knead @&(~1)shaggy dough{} with @cold water{1/4%cup}(60 mL) until smooth, then rest covered ~{30%min}.

Whisk @toasted sesame oil{2%Tbsp}(30 mL) with @flour for the paste{3%Tbsp}(24 g).

>> step: roll thin, spread, scatter, coil into a snail
Roll @&(~2)dough{} thin, spread with @&(~1)oil paste{}, scatter over @sliced scallions{1%cup}(60 g) and @fine sea salt{1%tsp}(6 g), then roll up and coil.

>> step: flatten, fry 3 min per side
Flatten @&(~1)coils{} and fry in @vegetable oil{3%Tbsp}(45 mL) ~{3%min} per side.
